Title: 0001-aros-shmem-and-process-stubs
Repository: pragtical
Base-Commit: 5c05f09e081833b581fb5ecd10e64963dec87f03
Requires: none
Author: aros-pragtical project
Date: 2026-09-20
Upstream-Status: candidate
Scope: AROS

Problem:
  AROS has no sys/mman.h or fork(); the editor would not compile or link
Solution:
  Process-local SDL allocations for shmem; process.spawn returns a Lua error until a later spawn patch. REPL history is disabled in meson, not here.
Validation:
  The Pragtical 3.14.0 x86_64 ABIv1 build compiled and linked on 2026-11-15. All six shared-memory runtime tests passed, including region growth and mirror handles. External spawning and cross-process sharing remain unavailable.
Removal:
  Replace the local implementations when tested AROS process spawning and cross-process shared memory are available.

